@page
@model PrivacyModel
@{
    ViewData["Title"] = "Privacy Policy";
}

<h1>Privacy Policy</h1>

<p>PaintPortal is a student coursework project. This page explains what data the site uses.</p>

<h2 class="h4">What we store</h2>
<ul>
    <li>Your email address and a hashed (not readable) password when you register.</li>
    <li>The list of paints in your personal palette.</li>
</ul>

<h2 class="h4">Cookies</h2>
<p>The site uses a single session cookie to keep you signed in. It is removed when you log out.</p>

<h2 class="h4">External services</h2>
<p>To describe paint colours, the server sends only the paint's colour code (for example, #B22222) to TheColorAPI. No personal data is sent.</p>